    "text": "As shown in the figure a body of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> moving vertically with speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> hits a smooth fixed inclined plane and rebounds with a velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;in the horizontal direction. If angle&nbsp;of incline is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></msup></math>, the velocity &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;will be<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0027906_Question.jpg\" style=\"width: 207px; height: 108px;\" />",
